{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000920/extras/21bacd4a896a48092a5b4dfba760cf64.avif?t=1758037043\" width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue your story in this next chapter as Captain Hale arrives in <strong>Fort Ninevus!</strong> Meet old acquaintances and make new friends, recruit companions, woo exotic women, solve quests, loot treasure, and explore the legendary Fort's secrets!\u00a0<strong><i>Through Stone &amp; Steel</i></strong> is the first free major expansion for <strong><i>Tales of Legendary Lust: Aphrodisia</i></strong>, with a planned release in\u00a0<strong>Q2 2026.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000920/extras/37debf6ab9d7d7e2f81ffcf9350d80d9.avif?t=1758037043\" width=1560 height=938 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A conspiracy stirs within the Ninth Legion!</strong> Uncover the machinations of an insidious death-cult... then gather your party and take up the sword against a mysterious <strong>Red Queen</strong> and her savage hordes, as you balance your duty against a tide of debauchery consuming the land...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000920/extras/0fcb26040defe2d691da891fbf484dd2.avif?t=1758037043\" width=1560 height=884 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLANNED FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>seamless addition to the base game</strong> bringing <strong>~15h</strong> of new content and RPG mechanics</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>explore 3 massive new outdoor areas</strong> (Fort Ninevus, Mount Krelengor, and Lake Mistral)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>multiple new adult scenes</i></strong><i> in the game's unique hand-painted style with written erotica</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>new companions for your party roster</i></strong><i>, some of them members of the <strong>Ninth Legion</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>more quests &amp; story progression &amp; role-play opportunities <strong>via the Captain's 10 Archetypes</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>put to good use all the items you've collected so far by engaging in <strong>crafting at anvils</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>outfit your party via <strong>inventory management</strong> &amp; crush your enemies in <strong>turn-based combat</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>new fully-illustrated CYOA book</strong>, featuring the return of choices and branching paths</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>brand new <strong>Text Adventures &amp; Perilous Undertakings</strong> with the <strong>Captain's Retinue</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>new Crises to resolve</i></strong><i> (Ninevus Repair, Briarshanks Trade Dispute, Sollaven Lust Affliction)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>world map</i></strong><i> for travel between areas, with random combat encounters &amp; travel events</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>gain access to Captain Hale's cabin</i></strong><i> (sleep, level-up, stash loot, craft gear, re-view lewds)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>relax at the Emerald Serpent Brothel</i></strong><i>\u00a0in between adventuring, and meet its courtesans</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>dedicated lewd gallery</i></strong><i>, with unlockable scenes that open as your progress the campaign</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>continue Meredith's storyline &amp; romance</i><